  "bundle_request_count": 18,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:1dad5b79b639856b1e7e95578237e8995a9d2b2862222a7d7856a745069c3f39",
      "request_id": "1dad5b79b639856b1e7e95578237e8995a9d2b2862222a7d7856a745069c3f39",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6fa7f77047c5cd05814ccefb8472f586",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二月达拉斯，面对弗里茨，他在决胜盘救回三个冠军点，最后逆转夺冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c3bf0fb79043446d76894f4ba4310b116c3fd6fbefb2c8ad50689f6bd3858bc3",
      "words_sha256": "af52fd9bf047f8ab0c68897a7d7d3313e00e07a8c6ebd7b664126051efb9a0b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:23935a43ed121de905e2e1e106270b1bd13951805d9ca31a20c38506a2cff6bf",
      "request_id": "23935a43ed121de905e2e1e106270b1bd13951805d9ca31a20c38506a2cff6bf",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "22fdc498101204619f047496c5abbc43",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛对兹维列夫，他四盘落败，收获亚军。从温网首轮到纽约决赛，他走出了完全不同的一段路。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0d9e080700b83599d886615370f19a277172ddaa5ba355efdedfcd93a18afa6d",
      "words_sha256": "1df17c35ca43669b25d3aab2e0aa12f22d2d989330e957d1a999a01f00f763da"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:29bf7848a24237c030f4ee45d5f36c63db59e5d0a83914c6fa789350d9a42a4e",
      "request_id": "29bf7848a24237c030f4ee45d5f36c63db59e5d0a83914c6fa789350d9a42a4e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "852336f2cdb5aa2d3f06ddc5e10a385e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "达维多维奇·福基纳，在上海决赛击败霍达尔。谢尔顿连续第二年，拿到都灵门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6ecc1c530f604431abcbb513564b649103b91489f7677eacbcad9d9d4fc1a8fd",
      "words_sha256": "5fb93e072a77bef862f42229de017fcba32ea1952cbbdadcd3d9e2b9fba97018"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2e7fc0d42f96bbc9c5801a7bc53f915147a4b010f03cf2f7a5650454dda533d0",
      "request_id": "2e7fc0d42f96bbc9c5801a7bc53f915147a4b010f03cf2f7a5650454dda533d0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6198fb655daf78dcc8d6a51857188d40",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "资格到手以后，巴塞尔止步第二轮。巴黎先过保罗这一关，再从一盘落后打进决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "124abb24acbc108a2896cc2b5a9d236abf30db1447aab22f0d5c1da2b4f1c699",
      "words_sha256": "f56893e321d35e87626f665054c58d649bfdd06d5f2a8354d8d1693e99bc6fe4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:321c8843295b5621bee207512ad62d8afcbf263729112e666b0b52681ae6673c",
      "request_id": "321c8843295b5621bee207512ad62d8afcbf263729112e666b0b52681ae6673c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5a20f9fb3d8c62ddfcaf66cbbeb59d25",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "截至十一月九日，谢尔顿五千一百七十分，赛季积分榜第四。辛纳已退赛，高亮的是本届年终的八位正选。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d720b940efd7c43c917bacc19a4ce361460e3ef608d4705669660f5716cad09a",
      "words_sha256": "6a5b008e86bb88063928f5194939ef863556a514a3a2dff65f5d312a466c9c42"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5d28abe81edfb1f825351f28225e40992ac3b32da93482d1029ebf88bd55f39e",
      "request_id": "5d28abe81edfb1f825351f28225e40992ac3b32da93482d1029ebf88bd55f39e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "86431bfba031e8709b56bd14f2ce63a3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四月慕尼黑，两盘击败科博利，赛季第二冠到手。这一回，他在红土上举起奖杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ca1410edf528464e32a9c7c75e1bea647a5f1a1e2b450efc23cd0372c9c954ed",
      "words_sha256": "6a479a3dfb38bca85668d033151072bc23595eb188f18199bd2d28cf1addd66a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:65e9d340da27d6cd9f1df6b4c54443d436f2d6fcdc748fec67111a2dc969631e",
      "request_id": "65e9d340da27d6cd9f1df6b4c54443d436f2d6fcdc748fec67111a2dc969631e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8b88a922cb6915abe1e9b203458036a8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "亚洲赛季，上海止步第三轮。十月十八日，另一场比赛替他锁定了年终席位。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d2b12d2e72a1bda1aca63994635036936c6b88cc3ce5bebc13edf5392bd7afa4",
      "words_sha256": "373acb43f6d2ce8106c011b39b46762032e07582660a19c67f7b4bc44b2ec408"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6f1396e11152c839721e6caf3e42bc062030a7c15beed8199b90c7de0dd56791",
      "request_id": "6f1396e11152c839721e6caf3e42bc062030a7c15beed8199b90c7de0dd56791",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "867da5a59a140aa1276b2713d056fcb1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可到了法网，他却在第二轮三盘输给科利尼翁。红土冠军，没有变成大满贯突破。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "822a6ca1dc6d59e1a7a4f9785b5df8ca7826112cb82d34d6e5bd7714bf8d29a8",
      "words_sha256": "0bcb2961931e7cd792348f24092946078fb62692e4da0c44e273ceffe6e76c77"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:854bd13770b9001286c863ff651282973892bbc120f63b77e3cda2865379d7d4",
      "request_id": "854bd13770b9001286c863ff651282973892bbc120f63b77e3cda2865379d7d4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e8f2f1e6598531f5b5c50c15e9c715fc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛再次遇到阿尔卡拉斯。美网他曾赢下这组对决，这次却两盘告负，收获巴黎亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "404d2fd7b0052a27250356668243bfa49264febe57e2c78869958a3b2d6cfa9f",
      "words_sha256": "dd106cfcba81e02f9dfc8e53c5858cb2301847a08681cd9e114a095919eacfe0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8588f839671a7449712da6bf395f62813950b3deb0b0670781bb1b5c2b0e19e2",
      "request_id": "8588f839671a7449712da6bf395f62813950b3deb0b0670781bb1b5c2b0e19e2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f53cf6ee2b1ad31f24b15f6e5aa488e9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先从澳网说起。打进8强之后，他三盘输给辛纳。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "079ddb5ed69054e4f588015dca7341f4b8a911a2f45284bb32ae9bebe40dff5d",
      "words_sha256": "fd8155dc59db567689cf3daee28ede46bce93cc26303e9c74a9242deeb436604"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:86aea89485d44329c31e403718c56a899aa22f7715a13808d6b50ecb91980f5b",
      "request_id": "86aea89485d44329c31e403718c56a899aa22f7715a13808d6b50ecb91980f5b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c73f345c3ea830e057af4460547efd15",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "八月，加拿大大师赛。他六场比赛一盘未失，两盘击败中岛布兰登，成功卫冕。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b7b3bd17618e1df9379ccf56234defefdcaab6d7eb6726cbc4605857466a0d0a",
      "words_sha256": "eef59795e6c2ea6e2692a3f0caf9ce5b7223de8e787c9a6d91d86b2e0ed378df"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8f9197fadfe5a3c8af33f75ab17ff7c833146e8b748c4e275e23cc298f4a9a42",
      "request_id": "8f9197fadfe5a3c8af33f75ab17ff7c833146e8b748c4e275e23cc298f4a9a42",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bf50c99d0939a64de26c88837611d37d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "谢尔顿年终路，从温网低谷到美网亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ce0f6cff2b5544342bb91310a368007df887287945a02b779966e93a73230519",
      "words_sha256": "1a7cf3b01326bb39a2216789fe201319bd4d9f120a81340d28bfd1930d742692"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b6ed6c850367b8715719584d8bfab5a2b5adb84702b75f6572a45244bd78902a",
      "request_id": "b6ed6c850367b8715719584d8bfab5a2b5adb84702b75f6572a45244bd78902a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d19ffebc45301d3b2cfdb6e35fe6a66",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半个月后的温网，决胜盘最后的抢十，他曾以八比五领先，还拿到一个赛点，最终却在第一轮出局。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d44743ab81748028f5f2e6728eb552ccf51d97d36242a888a065e290d3f8f25b",
      "words_sha256": "d9874dd437cbf5f7116621f9d2739ec8be7f86432a71799192f9d5d5fc387c4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5e79e5655e47efc2c0d3cee79eaeb80b9ff840b05900c74b39a6b72a62d8d70e",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:bbb9abe520901d57acab8a10f0c7ca0673a2a48d330b3e73ec70a05c545d835f",
      "request_id": "bbb9abe520901d57acab8a10f0c7ca0673a2a48d330b3e73ec70a05c545d835f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6ed189b565fe1b6b571a5f64c67cfdbc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "转上草地，斯图加特决赛又遇弗里茨。他三盘赢球，拿到生涯第一座草地冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c67c1a6dcddf7660ad48c890cf09fbc54229264b93055b445cf47a155c58f313",
      "words_sha256": "d7f0ac9056dae47660acdd2cc79cacfbf944dca61bb29a447ba0d810e2794df3"
    },
    {
