        "text": "四月慕尼黑，两盘击败科博利，赛季第二冠到手。这一回，他在红土上举起奖杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "822a6ca1dc6d59e1a7a4f9785b5df8ca7826112cb82d34d6e5bd7714bf8d29a8",
      "words_sha256": "0bcb2961931e7cd792348f24092946078fb62692e4da0c44e273ceffe6e76c77",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "867da5a59a140aa1276b2713d056fcb1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可到了法网，他却在第二轮三盘输给科利尼翁。红土冠军，没有变成大满贯突破。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c67c1a6dcddf7660ad48c890cf09fbc54229264b93055b445cf47a155c58f313",
      "words_sha256": "d7f0ac9056dae47660acdd2cc79cacfbf944dca61bb29a447ba0d810e2794df3",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6ed189b565fe1b6b571a5f64c67cfdbc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "转上草地，斯图加特决赛又遇弗里茨。他三盘赢球，拿到生涯第一座草地冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d44743ab81748028f5f2e6728eb552ccf51d97d36242a888a065e290d3f8f25b",
      "words_sha256": "d9874dd437cbf5f7116621f9d2739ec8be7f86432a71799192f9d5d5fc387c4d",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d19ffebc45301d3b2cfdb6e35fe6a66",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半个月后的温网，决胜盘最后的抢十，他曾以八比五领先，还拿到一个赛点，最终却在第一轮出局。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b7b3bd17618e1df9379ccf56234defefdcaab6d7eb6726cbc4605857466a0d0a",
      "words_sha256": "eef59795e6c2ea6e2692a3f0caf9ce5b7223de8e787c9a6d91d86b2e0ed378df",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c73f345c3ea830e057af4460547efd15",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "八月，加拿大大师赛。他六场比赛一盘未失，两盘击败中岛布兰登，成功卫冕。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "734d23f73e8c8287e2147b3f1e6491b527317cc88f2e813574015fdb110e619d",
      "words_sha256": "cb06a77fd1471b1c8011912c5bca393945734b7239d9c577376e4bd9509e8011",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c87d3616fdd94abb811791cf9815cdf6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网，他第一次击败阿尔卡拉斯，又逆转蒂亚福，第一次打进大满贯决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0d9e080700b83599d886615370f19a277172ddaa5ba355efdedfcd93a18afa6d",
      "words_sha256": "1df17c35ca43669b25d3aab2e0aa12f22d2d989330e957d1a999a01f00f763da",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "22fdc498101204619f047496c5abbc43",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛对兹维列夫，他四盘落败，收获亚军。从温网首轮到纽约决赛，他走出了完全不同的一段路。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d2b12d2e72a1bda1aca63994635036936c6b88cc3ce5bebc13edf5392bd7afa4",
      "words_sha256": "373acb43f6d2ce8106c011b39b46762032e07582660a19c67f7b4bc44b2ec408",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8b88a922cb6915abe1e9b203458036a8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "亚洲赛季，上海止步第三轮。十月十八日，另一场比赛替他锁定了年终席位。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6ecc1c530f604431abcbb513564b649103b91489f7677eacbcad9d9d4fc1a8fd",
      "words_sha256": "5fb93e072a77bef862f42229de017fcba32ea1952cbbdadcd3d9e2b9fba97018",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "852336f2cdb5aa2d3f06ddc5e10a385e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "达维多维奇·福基纳，在上海决赛击败霍达尔。谢尔顿连续第二年，拿到都灵门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "124abb24acbc108a2896cc2b5a9d236abf30db1447aab22f0d5c1da2b4f1c699",
      "words_sha256": "f56893e321d35e87626f665054c58d649bfdd06d5f2a8354d8d1693e99bc6fe4",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6198fb655daf78dcc8d6a51857188d40",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "资格到手以后，巴塞尔止步第二轮。巴黎先过保罗这一关，再从一盘落后打进决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "404d2fd7b0052a27250356668243bfa49264febe57e2c78869958a3b2d6cfa9f",
      "words_sha256": "dd106cfcba81e02f9dfc8e53c5858cb2301847a08681cd9e114a095919eacfe0",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e8f2f1e6598531f5b5c50c15e9c715fc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛再次遇到阿尔卡拉斯。美网他曾赢下这组对决，这次却两盘告负，收获巴黎亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d720b940efd7c43c917bacc19a4ce361460e3ef608d4705669660f5716cad09a",
      "words_sha256": "6a5b008e86bb88063928f5194939ef863556a514a3a2dff65f5d312a466c9c42",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5a20f9fb3d8c62ddfcaf66cbbeb59d25",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "截至十一月九日，谢尔顿五千一百七十分，赛季积分榜第四。辛纳已退赛，高亮的是本届年终的八位正选。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "71a4fd2856af8c1e8e614a374b66719a5ef7752b89353b4ac85c256ce60de49f",
      "words_sha256": "36c9d34a9571d0d6095a57ae50e1f7ab2c3e0e99e401a9a96b4a2e268e767a4e",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d8a30c3fc09e13d093abf17e474eecb4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "错过温网赛点，后来站上美网决赛。第二次到都灵，你看好谢尔顿冲进4强吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ce0f6cff2b5544342bb91310a368007df887287945a02b779966e93a73230519",
      "words_sha256": "1a7cf3b01326bb39a2216789fe201319bd4d9f120a81340d28bfd1930d742692",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bf50c99d0939a64de26c88837611d37d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "谢尔顿年终路，从温网低谷到美网亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
